  "item_short_desc": "<p>Embrace every adventure with Rothco's Thermal Knit Underwear, designed to keep you warm and comfortable throughout the day. Crafted with thermal knit fabric, it ensures superior warmth and protection from cold weather environments. Its snug fit, thanks to circular knitting, makes it ideal for layering under your clothes, providing an extra barrier against chilly winds. Whether worn as a base layer or standalone pajamas, its versatility knows no bounds.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
